<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
  <title>空氣的特性｜小學科學互動實驗室</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-cream: #fff9fb;
      --bg-dots: #fce7f3;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --chii-pink: #f472b6;
      --chii-pink-light: #fdf2f8;
      --hachi-blue: #38bdf8;
      --hachi-blue-light: #f0f9ff;
      --usagi-yellow: #facc15;
      --usagi-yellow-light: #fefce8;
      --ink-brown: #4a3728;
      --ink-muted: #7c6553;
      --shadow-cute: 0 5px 0 #e5d0c5;
      --radius-lg: 22px;
      --radius-md: 16px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "PingFang HK", "Microsoft JhengHei", "Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(var(--bg-dots) 2.2px, transparent 2.2px),
        radial-gradient(#e0f2fe 2.2px, var(--bg-cream) 2.2px);
      background-size: 36px 36px;
      background-position: 0 0, 18px 18px;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 14px 12px 40px;
    }

    .notebook-shell {
      max-width: 1140px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 3px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 26px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #d9c3b6, 0 14px 32px rgba(74, 55, 40, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .top-deco-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fce7f3 0%, #e0f2fe 50%, #fef9c3 100%);
      border-bottom: 3px dashed var(--ink-brown);
      padding: 12px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .title-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .chii-avatars {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .avatar-badge {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      background: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0 rgba(74, 55, 40, 0.16);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .title-text h1 {
      font-size: 1.52rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
    }

    .title-text p {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .reward-counter {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #e5d0c5;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .mission-bar {
      margin: 14px 18px 0;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: var(--usagi-yellow-light);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #e5d0c5;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .mission-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .mission-row-divider {
      border-top: 2px dashed #e5d0c5;
      padding-top: 10px;
    }

    .mission-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .step-tag {
      background: var(--chii-pink);
      color: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .mission-label {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .btn {
      appearance: none;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--ink-brown);
      transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.08s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--ink-brown);
    }

    .btn:active:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(2px);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--ink-brown);
    }

    .btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .btn-pink { background: #fbcfe8; }
    .btn-blue { background: #bae6fd; }
    .btn-yellow { background: #fef08a; }
    .btn-green { background: #bbf7d0; color: #14532d; }

    .preset-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .preset-chip {
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .preset-chip.active {
      background: var(--hachi-blue);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .preset-chip.custom-chip.active {
      background: var(--chii-pink);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .control-pill-group {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .lens-toggle-btn {
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .lens-toggle-btn.active {
      background: #a855f7;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .workspace {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.28fr 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 16px 18px 22px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .workspace {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .canvas-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 14px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-cute);
    }

    .canvas-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .step-progress {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: var(--hachi-blue-light);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .lens-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: #f3e8ff;
      color: #6b21a8;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .canvas-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      background: #fffdf9;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .canvas-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* 右欄：互動問答與因果排序區 */
    .side-panel {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .question-card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fdf2f8 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 15px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-cute);
    }

    .q-box {
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #f3e5dc;
    }

    .q-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #fef08a;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 1px 10px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .q-title {
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
    }

    .options-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .option-btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #e5d0c5;
      transition: all 0.1s;
    }

    .option-btn:hover {
      background: var(--usagi-yellow-light);
    }

    .option-btn.selected {
      background: #bae6fd;
      border-color: #0284c7;
      color: #0c4a6e;
    }

    .option-btn.wrong-choice {
      background: #ffe4e6;
      border-color: #e11d48;
      color: #be123c;
    }

    /* 因果流程圖排序槽（實驗 3 專用） */
    .chain-slots {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: var(--usagi-yellow-light);
      border: 2px dashed var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .chain-slot {
      min-width: 96px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-align: center;
      color: #be185d;
    }

    .ghost-draft-pill {
      display: none;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #475569;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1.5px dashed #94a3b8;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ghost-draft-pill.show {
      display: block;
    }

    /* 自訂日常現象面板 */
    .custom-setup-box {
      display: none;
      background: #fdf2f8;
      border: 2.5px solid #ec4899;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .custom-setup-box.show {
      display: block;
    }

    .character-stage {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .char-figure {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 18px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #e5d0c5;
    }

    .speech-bubble {
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      flex: 1;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .speech-speaker {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 1px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
    }

    .speaker-chii { background: #fbcfe8; }
    .speaker-hachi { background: #bae6fd; }
    .speaker-usagi { background: #fef08a; }

    .big-check-btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #f472b6;
      color: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .big-check-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #ec4899;
    }

    .feedback-box {
      background: #fff;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 14px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-cute);
    }

    .status-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .status-wait { background: #f3f4f6; }
    .status-ok { background: #bbf7d0; color: #14532d; }
    .status-retry { background: #fecdd3; color: #881337; }

    .guide-step {
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      background: var(--hachi-blue-light);
    }

    .guide-step.step-pink { background: var(--chii-pink-light); }
    .guide-step.step-yellow { background: var(--usagi-yellow-light); }

    .guide-step-title {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .guide-step p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .stamp-victory {
      border: 2.5px dashed #16a34a;
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* ====== 答對彈出獎勵卡視窗 (Modal) ====== */
    .reward-modal-backdrop {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(74, 55, 40, 0.65);
      backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 9999;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .reward-modal-backdrop.show {
      display: flex;
      animation: popIn 0.25s ease-out;
    }

    @keyframes popIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .reward-modal-card {
      background: #fffdf9;
      border: 4px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 26px;
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #d9c3b6, 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      max-height: 92vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .reward-modal-title {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #be185d;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .reward-modal-sub {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--ink-brown);
      background: #fef08a;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .reward-img-box {
      background: #fff;
      border: 3px solid var(--ink-brown);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #e5d0c5;
    }

    .reward-img-box img {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 360px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="notebook-shell">
    <!-- 頂部標題 -->
    <header class="top-deco-bar">
      <div class="title-group">
        <div class="chii-avatars" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="avatar-badge">
            <svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="3.5"/>
              <circle cx="48" cy="16" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="3.5"/>
              <circle cx="32" cy="35" r="22" fill="#fff" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="3.5"/>
              <ellipse cx="19" cy="39" rx="4.5" ry="2.6" fill="#f9a8d4"/>
              <ellipse cx="45" cy="39" rx="4.5" ry="2.6" fill="#f9a8d4"/>
              <circle cx="24" cy="33" r="3" fill="#4a3728"/>
              <circle cx="40" cy="33" r="3" fill="#4a3728"/>
              <path d="M29 38 Q32 41 35 38" fill="none" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="avatar-badge">
            <svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <polygon points="12,24 16,8 27,18" fill="#7dd3fc" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <polygon points="52,24 48,8 37,18" fill="#7dd3fc" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <circle cx="32" cy="36" r="21" fill="#fff" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="3.5"/>
              <path d="M13,27 Q24,25 32,16 Q40,25 51,27 A21,21 0 0,0 13,27 Z" fill="#7dd3fc"/>
              <circle cx="24" cy="34" r="3" fill="#4a3728"/>
              <circle cx="40" cy="34" r="3" fill="#4a3728"/>
              <path d="M29 39 Q32 42 35 39" fill="none" stroke="#4a3728" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="title-text">
          <h1>空氣的特性</h1>
          <p>1. 動手做模擬實驗 ➔ 2. 開啟「微觀透視鏡」睇空氣粒子 ➔ 3. 答問題換獎勵卡！</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reward-counter">
        <span>🏆 答對次數：<strong id="stampCount">0</strong> 次</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-yellow" id="viewRewardCardBtn" style="display:none; padding:4px 10px; font-size:0.82rem;">
          🎁 查看獎勵卡
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 第 1 步：選擇實驗單元與「微觀粒子透視鏡」 -->
    <section class="mission-bar">
      <div class="mission-row">
        <div class="mission-left">
          <span class="step-tag">第 1 步</span>
          <span class="mission-label">選擇空氣實驗室：</span>
        </div>

        <div class="preset-group" id="labButtons">
          <button type="button" class="preset-chip active" data-lab="space">🎈 1. 佔空間與有重量</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset-chip" data-lab="pressure">🧃 2. 大氣壓強（飲品盒）</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset-chip" data-lab="wind">🌊 3. 熱空氣上升與海風</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset-chip custom-chip" data-lab="daily">🏠 4. 日常現象與自訂題</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mission-row mission-row-divider">
        <div class="control-pill-group">
          <span>🔬 把無形空氣變可見：</span>
          <button type="button" class="lens-toggle-btn active" id="toggleMicroLensBtn">
            ✨ 微觀空氣粒子透視鏡：開
          </button>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-pink" id="actionExpBtn">
            ▶️ 按此進行實驗動作
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-blue" id="switchSubTopicBtn">
            🔄 切換實驗情境
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 主工作區 -->
    <main class="workspace">
      <!-- 左欄：互動科學實驗畫布 -->
      <section class="canvas-card">
        <div class="canvas-header">
          <div class="step-progress" id="expTitleBadge">
            🧪 實驗 A：倒轉杯子壓入水中（杯底有紙巾）
          </div>
          <div class="lens-badge" id="lensStatusBadge">
            🟣 透視鏡開啟中（圓點 = 空氣粒子）
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="canvas-container">
          <canvas id="scienceCanvas" width="600" height="420"></canvas>
        </div>

        <div class="canvas-toolbar">
          <span style="font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--ink-muted);" id="canvasBottomTip">
            💡 觀察：紫色小圓點代表看不見的<strong>空氣粒子</strong>！
          </span>
          <button type="button" class="btn" id="resetExpBtn">
            ↩ 重設實驗狀態
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 右欄：蘇格拉底漸進式問題與概念流程 -->
      <aside class="side-panel">
        <div class="question-card">
          <!-- 自訂日常現象設定框（在單元 4 可展開） -->
          <div class="custom-setup-box" id="customSetupBox">
            <div style="font-weight:900; font-size:0.9rem; color:#831843; margin-bottom:6px;">
              ✏️ 自訂日常現象題目（老師或同學出題）：
            </div>
